+# Memory-Aware Retrospective Report
+
+## Early Design Decisions (from memory_summary.md)
+
+- CLI uses `run` subcommand.
+- Configuration files are optional (JSON/YAML).
+- Internal paths are resolved from repo root.
+- Report stage only reads cleaned data and rejects.
+- Tests first cover failure retries and rejects, then extend report fields.
+
+## Compatibility & Environment (from compatibility-notes.md)
+
+- Current `pyproject.toml` configures pytest paths and pythonpath only for this fixture.
+- No full Python version matrix declared; historical runs from single dev environment.
+
+## Performance Baseline (from benchmarks/perf-baseline.json)
+
+- Dataset: local fixture sample (5 rows).
+- Baseline note: tiny sample; not a general performance benchmark.
+
+## Final Pipeline Statistics (current state)
+
+Running `python -m mini_harness.cli run data/input.csv data/events.jsonl`:
+
+- processed_count: 4
+- rejected_count: 2
+- retry_count: 0
+- source_files: ['input.csv', 'events.jsonl']
+
+The pipeline successfully extracted and cleaned records from both CSV and JSONL sources, rejecting records missing a valid `id` field.
+
+## Milestone Achievements
+
+- M1: Bootstrap CLI and mini_harness package.
+- M2: JSON/YAML config support.
+- M3: DAG runner with retries (max 2).
+- M4: Enhanced CLI to handle missing files from config.
+- M5: Verified harness works from different working directories.
+- M6: Identified unrelated external cache log; confirmed handoff note.
+- M7: Generated this report referencing memory, compatibility notes, and performance baseline.
+
+All tests pass (pytest 7 passed).
